Explanation:

\(\\ \left[\mathrm{Ni}(\mathrm{CN})_{4}\right]^{2-} \Rightarrow \mathrm{Ni}^{2+}
\Rightarrow 3 \mathrm{~d}^{8} 4 \mathrm{~s}^{0} \Rightarrow \mathrm{dsp}^{2}=
\text{Square planar} \Rightarrow \text{diamagnetic} \\
\left[\mathrm{Ni}(\mathrm{CO})_{4}\right] \Rightarrow \mathrm{Ni} \Rightarrow 3
\mathrm{~d}^{8} 4 \mathrm{~s}^{2} \Rightarrow 3 \mathrm{~d}^{10}=\mathrm{sp}^{3}
\Rightarrow\text{ Tetrahedral} \Rightarrow \text{diamagnetic}
\\\left[\mathrm{NiCl}_{4}\right]^{2-} \Rightarrow \mathrm{Ni}^{2+} \Rightarrow 3
\mathrm{~d}^{8} 4 \mathrm{~s}^{0} \Rightarrow\mathrm{sp}^{3} \Rightarrow\text{
Tetrahedral} \Rightarrow \text{paramagnetic}\)



